{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every plate, it is positioned on the top side of the image. To the right of the plate is a spoon, and to the right of the spoon is a lemon; both the spoon and the lemon are visually smaller than the plate. Directly below the plate is a remote, and below the remote is a calculator. To the right of the remote lies a pair of pliers, with scissors located further to the right of the pliers. Additionally, a wrench is positioned below the pliers.",
